# CC per-project memory/session dir — never track (guards the work subtree leak purged from history)
.claude/projects/

# Cross-tool handoffs are local-only session state — may carry work-tenant content.
# Only the spec (README) and the pre-protocol personal exemplar stay tracked.
.config/adots/handoffs/*.md
!.config/adots/handoffs/README.md
!.config/adots/handoffs/2026-06-23.md

# Machine-local git identity and signing — may carry an employer email or key.
.config/git/config.identity
.config/git/config.signing
.config/git/allowed_signers
